  ]} />

  <CourseCTA text="No matter whether you record on an agile mirrorless hybrid or a specialized cinema rig, transforming raw digital sensor files into dramatic visual storytelling depends entirely upon your mastering DaVinci Resolve." />

</article>

</Layout>
